  "notes": "Log at 0x203968 (ms counter), 0x20396C (event count), 0x203970 (16 x 8-byte ring: ms, tag<<24 | value). tools/logread.py maps the tags (see 'tags') to F (panel off), N (panel on), S (OSD timer expiry), E (state 4 entry), G (gate result), M (main loop start), B (backlight on), C (after a start-up call, c_<call address>), P (port state change: n << 8 | state), Q (mailbox command inside mailbox_window_ms: cmd << 16 | sub << 12 | first data byte << 4). The log is in RAM and starts empty at every firmware start. Generated by tools/patches_src_diag_log.py."
